 "<b style=\"font-size:30px;color:#0d1626\">Cámara</b><br>Cuartetos y quintetos en el foyer, a media luz.": "<b style=\"font-size:30px;color:#0d1626\">Chamber</b><br>Quartets and quintets in the foyer, with the lights low.",
 "<b style=\"font-size:30px;color:#0d1626\">En familia</b><br>Domingos a las doce, con cuentos y menos de una hora.": "<b style=\"font-size:30px;color:#0d1626\">Family</b><br>Sundays at noon, with stories and under an hour long.",
